{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1JN","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約翰一書","commonName":"約翰一書","title":"約翰一書","order":62,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"82f681963d16a8cc2367c1e2d0120071f23c2cc3ad84496a532df4642c076de9","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1JN/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":104},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["生命之道"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["關於從太初就已經存在的生命之道，我們曾經耳聞目睹，親眼看過，親手摸過。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["這生命曾顯現過，我們看見了，現在作見證，向你們傳揚這與父同在、曾向我們顯現的永恆生命。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我們把所見所聞傳給你們，好使你們可以與我們相交。我們誠然是與父和祂兒子耶穌基督相交。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我們把這些話寫給你們，好使大家都喜樂滿溢。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["要活在光中"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我們從耶穌那裡聽見、現在又傳給你們的信息就是：上帝是光，在祂裡面毫無黑暗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我們如果說與祂相交，卻仍活在黑暗裡，就是說謊，沒有遵行真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我們如果生活在光明中，像上帝在光明中一樣，就彼此相交，祂兒子耶穌的血就洗淨我們一切的罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我們如果說自己沒有罪，便是自欺，真理就不在我們裡面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["如果我們承認自己的罪，上帝是信實和公義的，必赦免我們的罪，洗淨我們一切的不義。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我們如果說自己沒有犯過罪，就是把上帝看作說謊的，祂的道也不在我們裡面。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1JN/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2PE/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}